| G1.1.3  | Handover Meals | Achieve | Meals handed over | - | Correct handover process |
| G1.2    | Retrieve Dishes | Achieve | Dishes retrieved | AND | Identification and transport required |
| G1.2.1  | Identify Dishes | Perform | Dishes detected | - | Detection of dirty dishes |
| G1.2.2  | Transport Dishes | Achieve | Dishes collected | - | Move dishes correctly |
| G0      | Manage Info | Query | Patient data, companion, capability | AND | All info needed for mission |
